File:Flag Ceuta.svg|[[Flag of Ceuta]], depicting a coat of arms over a background consisting of eight black and white triangles arranged in a pinwheel pattern.
File:Flag of Melilla.svg|[[Flag of Melilla]], depicting a coat of arms over a blue background.
